# 34.5 NP-Complete Problems

This reader page presents the selected textbook chain beyond CLIQUE.

## Main results

- VERTEX-COVER is NP-complete.
- HAM-CYCLE is NP-complete.
- Decision-TSP is NP-complete.
- SUBSET-SUM is NP-complete.

Each result combines an honest serialized language, bounded certificate
semantics, a fixed polynomial-time verifier, and a total polynomial-time
reduction machine.

